[[{"sha":"08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405","node_id":"C_kwDOOns7hdoAKDA4YmZjNmY2MjUxOTI4ZDIwNmUyZjBiY2IwZWEzODdlNGQzZTk0MDU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/commits/08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/commit/08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405","author":{"name":"noamblitz","email":"noamblitz@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-20T10:39:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"noamblitz","email":"noamblitz@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-20T10:39:38Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0780e13ba8e0401c507eab3ea700834f3a5ec76b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/trees/0780e13ba8e0401c507eab3ea700834f3a5ec76b"},"message":"Project default output to declared fields\n\napply_json_mango_query now accepts allowed_fields; when the pipeline\nhas no $project, the default queryset.values() call restricts to those\nfields instead of returning every concrete column on the model. Keeps\nnon-serializable columns (e.g. GeoDjango PointField) out of the JSON\nrenderer when the caller hasn't projected explicitly.\n\n_QueryExecutor passes ModelQueryToolset.fields minus get_excluded_fields().\nBehaviour is unchanged when `fields` is not declared on the toolset.","parents":[{"sha":"0599c7d45a242519b6bdb63775bd07228c5f70d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/commits/0599c7d45a242519b6bdb63775bd07228c5f70d6","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/commit/0599c7d45a242519b6bdb63775bd07228c5f70d6"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEEN0+5Ue5x87wZaZL4yrM6HJ4weBgFAmnmAmoACgkQyrM6HJ4w\neBi3OwwArKb9FNz8uGyAxCkULY9vd/o/vr8LM9Y52pqHgCehj4VUfeuCti4e3xks\nQ9fOuozXPAsh28Z8PCFR0U9MpPAxlpd3MoBWU6a5xlGwdQJ7Qm7o+kvpAjy10Xia\n8jRhTSMfQuV1KnJVJkkr2SEn5vjzZ9dsyzaNGtaFK1m2jHczwLP0/ju5baGmRZdm\nQi1IqGNIIbnkFJDESSyecGX9+JQUv7+P2LH2yQYYmr0vF1XcbrE+AXIZsgfQwa3L\n1a1P0oJocCh2nOz5m1/erOayjKlqoHhcA9pDOU7BC0Vrx8fSHGfNTAhw9rarG1xO\nX93loFgZPgQ1NCNwTYe3P5kNaCTb90pLBjjwG5krasibW5w50xGvHUGD/sBTJ4dn\nxy2ISIkORXvi5ggICdKu9MHV2g3WmUiB4EIyX0aOZhFidKFk5GNSthp+U9SxWxlg\n0Zv4zCtBlnkhmr9l1a7CwaqCFtDyhFvHxqQ1DA7qZPkxiuHXXTDpNy8h7QXtR4VS\nodor9xFT\n=r7O4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 0780e13ba8e0401c507eab3ea700834f3a5ec76b\nparent 0599c7d45a242519b6bdb63775bd07228c5f70d6\nauthor noamblitz <noamblitz@gmail.com> 1776681578 +0200\ncommitter noamblitz <noamblitz@gmail.com> 1776681578 +0200\n\nProject default output to declared fields\n\napply_json_mango_query now accepts allowed_fields; when the pipeline\nhas no $project, the default queryset.values() call restricts to those\nfields instead of returning every concrete column on the model. Keeps\nnon-serializable columns (e.g. GeoDjango PointField) out of the JSON\nrenderer when the caller hasn't projected explicitly.\n\n_QueryExecutor passes ModelQueryToolset.fields minus get_excluded_fields().\nBehaviour is unchanged when `fields` is not declared on the toolset.\n","verified_at":"2026-04-20T10:39:55Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"89e181991b819be2c83fae5e3ab58eb7023716d8","node_id":"C_kwDOOns7hdoAKDg5ZTE4MTk5MWI4MTliZTJjODNmYWU1ZTNhYjU4ZWI3MDIzNzE2ZDg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/commits/89e181991b819be2c83fae5e3ab58eb7023716d8","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/commit/89e181991b819be2c83fae5e3ab58eb7023716d8","author":{"name":"noamblitz","email":"noamblitz@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-20T11:03:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"noamblitz","email":"noamblitz@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-20T11:03:41Z"},"tree":{"sha":"be525fbb6f8950b4a9e2fca4cbd6d97d21f39efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/trees/be525fbb6f8950b4a9e2fca4cbd6d97d21f39efb"},"message":"Also strip undeclared fields from explicit $project + rename test class\n\nThe previous commit closed the no-$project path but explicit $project\nstages still leaked undeclared fields:\n  {\"$project\": {\"street\": 1}}           # direct\n  {\"$project\": {\"renamed\": \"$street\"}}  # rename bypass\n\nFilter the $project spec before interpretation: drop any mapping whose\nsource field isn't in allowed_fields. Alias-prefixed sources\n(e.g. $loc.name) and exclusions ({_id: 0}) pass through unchanged.\n\n$match / $sort still execute against undeclared columns — that leaves\na \"does this row exist\" side-channel but no value leak in output.\n\nRename test class to UndeclaredFieldsNotReturnedTest to reflect the\nsecurity property being pinned, and add cases for the two explicit-\nprojection leak paths.","parents":[{"sha":"08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/git/commits/08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/commit/08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEEN0+5Ue5x87wZaZL4yrM6HJ4weBgFAmnmCA0ACgkQyrM6HJ4w\neBhyHAwAkokLn988KuNJsjyCWfKCj9fhGhTr7hohxarEdK3MuZ3v/RlqODR+CO9y\nMh2lLimv8eG/58TCuvvTSZD86bWpyWJi2tRirbC8krce5td6VzRQIdcXou0kLcy1\n/6dQA9V5O9vz1rU2a07EaYBvFCLJ6pU/Mkyv4rkTbMkWwiiGsUPHntI+CNFa0gF1\nlxC6Y7GyamofZFjuQid0cLmua9DCUedKcn82XY9Qowt6vI10caE/Ud872F/9pMhJ\nlxUz7oeiFQk59xgpIs7P5TbYzza9Eaiu+0c0iH0V3RDSZpjEbTOVGDR9IRfvldZB\nrh5/GSxIfd/0AsU195AcWQxzaVodbClmfSz99ERV9MF3ouUwbKn1fXRyzbxk9i7g\nvaHMpYmBonnjuBsdfAsGSX7DQX0l/8pP25zByNV792Euk5BS7e6zxqj7IdNS2BQA\n93iDPRPYnxwxO6Ul9ZA3Ve8M9Ka/NOy6QPKSWRS5MaMq+jwLkXBZa0Mm/1j0xCBN\nmYRzeGci\n=/791\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree be525fbb6f8950b4a9e2fca4cbd6d97d21f39efb\nparent 08bfc6f6251928d206e2f0bcb0ea387e4d3e9405\nauthor noamblitz <noamblitz@gmail.com> 1776683021 +0200\ncommitter noamblitz <noamblitz@gmail.com> 1776683021 +0200\n\nAlso strip undeclared fields from explicit $project + rename test class\n\nThe previous commit closed the no-$project path but explicit $project\nstages still leaked undeclared fields:\n  {\"$project\": {\"street\": 1}}           # direct\n  {\"$project\": {\"renamed\": \"$street\"}}  # rename bypass\n\nFilter the $project spec before interpretation: drop any mapping whose\nsource field isn't in allowed_fields. Alias-prefixed sources\n(e.g. $loc.name) and exclusions ({_id: 0}) pass through unchanged.\n\n$match / $sort still execute against undeclared columns — that leaves\na \"does this row exist\" side-channel but no value leak in output.\n\nRename test class to UndeclaredFieldsNotReturnedTest to reflect the\nsecurity property being pinned, and add cases for the two explicit-\nprojection leak paths.\n","verified_at":"2026-04-20T11:03:44Z"},"event":"committed"},{"actor":{"login":"originalsouth","id":5300799,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDA3OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5300799?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth","html_url":"https://github.com/originalsouth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/originalsouth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T11:25:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T11:25:50Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/52","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server","labels_url"